        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-12-26T19:09:03.935Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Skipping way ahead, because I can’t wait until next Tuesday for this episode, quite possibly my absolute favorite they ever did.  It’s certainly one of the biggest shakeups they’ve ever done; Aeternus didn’t exist at all before this week, as far as we know, and it’s debatably a bigger threat than OblivAeon!  I don’t think anything ever changed the setting as much as this cosmological retcon.</p>\n<p>Maln, I didn’t realize that they created Darkstryfe and Painstake in this same episode.  I thought that was a separate Creative Process.</p>",
